Obviously, my target is going to be...

245
00:14:45,620 --> 00:14:48,180
Lord Poison, Marek's only monster.

246
00:14:49,100 --> 00:14:52,740
All right, Marek, I aim
Yugi's attack at you.

247
00:14:54,900 --> 00:14:55,730
Hmm, really?

248
00:14:56,140 --> 00:14:59,200
Not if I activate this mirror force.

249
00:15:01,040 --> 00:15:02,620
What? No way!

250
00:15:02,940 --> 00:15:06,440
Yes, so I'm able to reflect
the attack back at Yugi.

251
00:15:06,700 --> 00:15:08,580
So your monster's destroyed.

252
00:15:08,760 --> 00:15:10,460
Are you sure? What?

253
00:15:10,780 --> 00:15:12,797
Now I activate my trap!

254
00:15:12,880 --> 00:15:14,760
Seven tools of the bandit!

255
00:15:15,160 --> 00:15:17,880
My car deactivates your mirror force.

256
00:15:18,100 --> 00:15:21,580
Nice try, Merrick, but your
trap didn't work. Oh, no!

257
00:15:32,820 --> 00:15:34,520
Wow, this tool's intense.

258
00:15:34,920 --> 00:15:37,657
My brother redirected
Yugi's attack to Merrick,

259
00:15:37,740 --> 00:15:40,457
and then Merrick tried to
reflect that attack back to Yugi.

260
00:15:40,540 --> 00:15:43,640
But it didn't work, so Marek
took the damage anyway.

261
00:15:44,500 --> 00:15:47,760
Marek, your life points
just went down by 700.

262
00:15:47,920 --> 00:15:50,440
So go up there with the other chump.

263
00:15:51,280 --> 00:15:55,020
Now Marek's tied with me, so I
may face him in the semifinals.

264
00:15:56,600 --> 00:15:59,540
I'm not the only one
who loses life points.

265
00:15:59,740 --> 00:16:02,446
You played Seven Tools
of the Bandit, Pharaoh.

266
00:16:02,620 --> 00:16:07,060
That card costs you 1,000 life
points, so your chair rises as well.

267
00:16:07,260 --> 00:16:08,380
I'm aware of that.

268
00:16:09,340 --> 00:16:10,260
What's this?

269
00:16:10,800 --> 00:16:13,940
Yugi has to win so he can duel me next!

270
00:16:14,380 --> 00:16:16,040
Yugi's in last place now!

271
00:16:16,200 --> 00:16:19,797
I know, but I think he lost those
life points on purpose, Taya!

272
00:16:19,880 --> 00:16:24,351
Remember, the first two duelists to
lose face each other in the semi-finals!

273
00:16:24,620 --> 00:16:29,720
Yugi's still planning to protect Wheeler
from dueling against Marek! My move!

274
00:16:30,160 --> 00:16:33,557
If I don't draw a monster now,
this turn is gonna be my last!

275
00:16:33,640 --> 00:16:35,111
Come on, I need a winner!

276
00:16:35,560 --> 00:16:36,480
Here it goes!

277
00:16:37,980 --> 00:16:38,810
Awesome!

278
00:16:38,893 --> 00:16:43,800
I summon Gear Freed, the
Iron Knight, in attack mode.

279
00:16:45,340 --> 00:16:47,752
About time he got a monster on the field.

280
00:16:47,880 --> 00:16:49,260
Joey, way to go!

281
00:16:49,500 --> 00:16:52,877
Now that I got a monster, it's
time to do a little damage.

282
00:16:52,960 --> 00:16:54,020
Now, let's see.

283
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:57,457
All three of them blew their
face down cards last turn.

284
00:16:57,540 --> 00:17:00,180
And those two have no
monsters on the field.

285
00:17:00,660 --> 00:17:02,420
I could blast Maric.

286
00:17:02,940 --> 00:17:04,700
Nah, I got a better idea.

287
00:17:05,040 --> 00:17:06,393
I'm going for Rich Boy.

288
00:17:07,240 --> 00:17:08,620
Take this, Kaiba!

289
00:17:09,060 --> 00:17:10,660
Now, tear free to attack!

290
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:14,160
Go straight for his life, boys!

291
00:17:15,100 --> 00:17:17,220
This'll put Kaiba in last place!

292
00:17:23,280 --> 00:17:24,340
Big brother!

293
00:17:24,680 --> 00:17:25,820
Yeah, all right!

294
00:17:27,140 --> 00:17:30,860
Wheeler, I assure you, you
won't be laughing much longer.

295
00:17:31,380 --> 00:17:32,210
What's wrong?

296
00:17:32,380 --> 00:17:36,297
Last I checked, you wanted to go to
the top of your duel tower, Kaiba.

297
00:17:36,380 --> 00:17:38,200
Why did Joey attack Kaiba?

298
00:17:38,740 --> 00:17:41,120
Now Kaiba and I are closest to the top,

299
00:17:41,300 --> 00:17:44,065
and Joey and Merrick are
closest to the bottom!

300
00:17:44,460 --> 00:17:45,290
Oh, no!

301
00:17:45,660 --> 00:17:48,542
Joey must want to face
Merrick in the semifinals!

302
00:17:49,560 --> 00:17:50,820
You're mine, Merrick.

303
00:17:51,080 --> 00:17:53,962
It's time for you to pay
for what you did to Mai.

304
00:17:57,280 --> 00:17:58,340
Don't worry, Mai.

305
00:17:58,700 --> 00:18:02,177
As soon as I crush Merrick, I'll get
your mind back from the Shadow Realm,

306
00:18:02,260 --> 00:18:03,495
just like I promised.

307
00:18:03,740 --> 00:18:07,920
For my last move, I'll place one
card face down and end my turn.

308
00:18:08,200 --> 00:18:10,380
About time. My move.

309
00:18:10,700 --> 00:18:13,660
If I want to face Yugi in the semi-finals,

310
00:18:13,940 --> 00:18:18,234
all I have to do is make sure that he
and I both lose this four-way duel.

311
00:18:19,180 --> 00:18:22,540
But I can't let myself
lose a duel on purpose.

312
00:18:23,160 --> 00:18:26,417
I'll place three cards face
down on the field and then

313
00:18:26,500 --> 00:18:29,500
I'll summon the mighty
Blade Knight in attack mode.

314
00:18:30,240 --> 00:18:32,037
I won't throw this duel.

315
00:18:32,120 --> 00:18:35,840
Time to lose more life points, Marek. Huh?

316
00:18:36,280 --> 00:18:39,440
Now, Blade Knight, attack Marek directly.

317
00:18:49,400 --> 00:18:51,720
Going up. Aw, man.

318
00:18:51,940 --> 00:18:54,837
This hurts my chances of
facing Marek in the next round.

319
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:57,040
This four-way duel's confusing.

320
00:18:57,360 --> 00:19:00,857
Yeah, it seems like everyone's
trying to duel somebody else.

321
00:19:00,940 --> 00:19:05,587
I hope you're not afraid of heights,
Marek, because it's a long way to the top.

322
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:12,220
I'll make sure Marek and Wheeler lose this
duel, so I face Yu-Gi in the semi-finals.

323
00:19:12,420 --> 00:19:17,940
Then I'll prove once and for all that I am
a far better duelist than he'll ever be.

324
00:19:18,220 --> 00:19:23,480
I'll pit my obelisk, the Tormenter,
against his slifer, the Sky Dragon.

325
00:19:24,420 --> 00:19:29,600
And when these two Egyptian gods clash,
Yu-Gi will learn what torment is all about.

326
00:20:00,240 --> 00:20:01,070
I love you.
